  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Con, +1 Cha\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Nature, Survival\nPassive Affinity: You begin with Earth Release Affinity\nCrystal Release: The Shoton Clan has access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s).\nHijutsu Flexibility: Shoton Clan Hijutsu can use either Intelligence or Charisma as its casting ability score.\nCrystallization: As a Bonus action, you can conjure one melee or ranged weapon with a bulk of 2 or up to two melee weapons with a bulk of 1 that you are proficient in. These weapon shares any weapon seals found on weapons you currently have that it qualifies for. These weapons are known as Crystal Weapons.",
